    "Name": "Lafayette HMBT",
    "Details": "Created as a heavy assault unit that could take on anything up to and including assault Mechs, the 80 ton Lafayette Heavy MBT was created for the SLDFs exclusive use. A 160 rated XL Engine allowed designers to cram a pair of ER PPCs and an AC/20 into the vehicles turret. What few  Lafayettes survived the Amaris Civil War would be taken by the departing SLDF and are rumoured to still be hidden away on the Clan homeworlds. Comstar and the Word of Blake maintain a small quantity of salvaged Lafayettes.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 2/3 hexes / 60/90 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       205     40\n<b>Left</b>         170     40\n<b>Right</b>       170     40\n<b>Rear</b>        135     40\n<b>Turret</b>      170     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      850    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color>",
    "Icon": "Schrek"
  },
